SSEEEE AALLSSOO
     ig4(4)

BBUUGGSS
     The iiiicchhiidd does not support GPIO interrupts yet.  In that case iiiicchhiidd en‐
     ables sampling mode with periodic polling of hardware by driver means.
     See dev.iichid.*.sampling_* sysctl(8) variables for tuning of sampling
     parameters.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The iiiicchhiidd driver first appeared in FreeBSD 13.0.

